{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120336","id":3871838869,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7mx5KV","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120336","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120336.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120336.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120336","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120336/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120336/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120336/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/68f0f410f0cd30750cbcb8ce1ac91a792523f156","number":120336,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix deadlock in resource loader when waiting for message queue flush","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"While we are waiting for a resource to finish loading in `load_threaded_get()`, if there are task threads waiting on the main message queue to be flushed (because we're waiting for `resource_changed_connections` to propagate), and we're waiting for those tasks to finish, we will deadlock. We have to flush the message queue in order to prevent a deadlock.\r\n\r\nIf, in the above scenario, the message queue is flushing (i.e. because `load_threaded_get()` was called deferred), we won't be able to flush the message queue, so we should just fail to load.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_use